    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to Sector 7G, a neon-drenched alleyway in the underbelly of Neo-Kowloon. The acid rain never seems to stop here, washing the grime of the city into the overcrowded gutters. You are a street-smart data runner whose latest extraction job just went terribly sideways. Now, hunted by relentless corporate enforcers, you've taken refuge in this abandoned hacker den. The air is thick with the smell of ozone, cheap synthetics, and burning silicon. Before you lies a tangled web of jury-rigged terminals, salvaged memory drives, and glowing cryptographic servers. Your only way out of this lockdown is to systematically process the raw data, sanitize the corrupted corporate files, and execute the hidden override codes. You must piece together the scattered technology in the room, follow the digital breadcrumbs, and outsmart the grid. Time is running out. Use your wits to navigate the network, unlock the secured containers, and trigger the final execution sequence before the corporate hit squads breach the reinforced steel door.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
  },
